# What working in this repository leaves behind. The UI's build, its cache and
# node_modules are in ui/.gitignore, beside the workspace that makes them; this
# file is the Python half -- the venv, the interpreter's own output, and the
# artefacts of the three tools the commands in CLAUDE.md run.

# Byte-compiled / optimized / DLL files
__pycache__/
*.py[codz]
*$py.class

# Environments
#   The README makes .venv with stdlib venv; the rest are the other spellings.
.venv
venv/
env/
ENV/
.env
.envrc

# pytest and coverage
.pytest_cache/
.coverage
.coverage.*
coverage.xml
htmlcov/

# mypy
#   Where the type checker keeps what it worked out last time, so a second run over an
#   unchanged package is most of a second rather than most of a minute.
.mypy_cache/

# mutmut
#   A run copies the tree to mutants/ and tests the copy; the results file is
#   what .github/workflows/mutation.yml reports from and uploads.
mutants/
mutation-results.txt

# Stray output
*.log
